  "content_html": "<div style=\"font-family:'Noto Sans KR','Malgun Gothic',sans-serif;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;color:#1e293b;word-break:keep-all;background:#f8fafc;padding:0;border-radius:16px;\">\n\n<div style=\"background:#0f172a;border-radius:14px;padding:22px;margin-bottom:2em;border:1px solid #1e293b;\"><p style=\"font-size:0.7em;font-weight:700;color:#475569;letter-spacing:2.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 14px;font-family:monospace;\">MAJOR INDEX</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:22px;\"><div style=\"background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 14px;flex:1;min-width:110px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #334155;\"><div style=\"font-size:0.72em;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">나스닥</div><div style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-weight:800;color:#f1f5f9;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\">26,683.94</div><div style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.10);border-radius:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">▲ +3.39%</span></div></div><div style=\"background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 14px;flex:1;min-width:110px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #334155;\"><div style=\"font-size:0.72em;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">S&P500</div><div style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-weight:800;color:#f1f5f9;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\">7,554.29</div><div style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.10);border-radius:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">▲ +2.16%</span></div></div><div style=\"background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 14px;flex:1;min-width:110px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #334155;\"><div style=\"font-size:0.72em;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">다우존스</div><div style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-weight:800;color:#f1f5f9;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\">51,671.03</div><div style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.10);border-radius:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">▲ +1.62%</span></div></div><div style=\"background:#1e293b;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 14px;flex:1;min-width:110px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #334155;\"><div style=\"font-size:0.72em;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:0.5px;\">VIX</div><div style=\"font-size:1.2em;font-weight:800;color:#f1f5f9;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\">16.16</div><div style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(248,113,113,0.10);border-radius:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#f87171;\">▼ -0.25%</span></div></div></div><p style=\"font-size:0.7em;font-weight:700;color:#475569;letter-spacing:2.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 12px;font-family:monospace;\">MACRO</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:22px;\"><div style=\"background:#0f172a;border:1px solid #1e293b;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;flex:1;min-width:100px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:0.72em;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:4px;\">달러인덱스</div><div style=\"font-size:1.05em;font-weight:700;color:#cbd5e1;\">99.66</div><div style=\"font-size:0.8em;font-weight:600;color:#22c55e;margin-top:3px;\">▲ +0.03%</div></div><div style=\"background:#0f172a;border:1px solid #1e293b;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;flex:1;min-width:100px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:0.72em;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:4px;\">WTI유가</div><div style=\"font-size:1.05em;font-weight:700;color:#cbd5e1;\">78.39</div><div style=\"font-size:0.8em;font-weight:600;color:#f87171;margin-top:3px;\">▼ -2.92%</div></div><div style=\"background:#0f172a;border:1px solid #1e293b;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;flex:1;min-width:100px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:0.72em;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:4px;\">금선물</div><div style=\"font-size:1.05em;font-weight:700;color:#cbd5e1;\">4,349.60</div><div style=\"font-size:0.8em;font-weight:600;color:#22c55e;margin-top:3px;\">▲ +0.5%</div></div></div><p style=\"font-size:0.7em;font-weight:700;color:#475569;letter-spacing:2.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 10px;font-family:monospace;\">US STOCKS &amp; KR IMPACT</p><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.88em;background:#0f172a;\"><thead><tr style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #334155;\"><th style=\"padding:8px 14px;text-align:left;color:#475569;font-weight:600;font-size:0.8em;\">종목</th><th style=\"padding:8px 14px;text-align:right;color:#475569;font-weight:600;font-size:0.8em;\">현재가</th><th style=\"padding:8px 14px;text-align:right;color:#475569;font-weight:600;font-size:0.8em;\">등락</th><th style=\"padding:8px 14px;text-align:left;color:#475569;font-weight:600;font-size:0.8em;\">한국 연관</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #1e293b;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.9em;\">엔비디아</span><span style=\"color:#475569;font-size:0.75em;margin-left:6px;\">NVDA</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.88em;font-weight:600;\">212.45</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.07);border-radius:20px;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">+3.7%</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.8em;\">삼성전자, SK하이닉스, 한미반도체</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #1e293b;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.9em;\">AMD</span><span style=\"color:#475569;font-size:0.75em;margin-left:6px;\">AMD</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.88em;font-weight:600;\">547.26</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.07);border-radius:20px;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">+12.04%</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.8em;\">삼성전자, SK하이닉스</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #1e293b;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.9em;\">인텔</span><span style=\"color:#475569;font-size:0.75em;margin-left:6px;\">INTC</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.88em;font-weight:600;\">127.86</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.07);border-radius:20px;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">+9.32%</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.8em;\">삼성전자</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #1e293b;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.9em;\">TSMC</span><span style=\"color:#475569;font-size:0.75em;margin-left:6px;\">TSM</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.88em;font-weight:600;\">441.40</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.07);border-radius:20px;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">+4.83%</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.8em;\">삼성전자, DB하이텍</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #1e293b;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.9em;\">애플</span><span style=\"color:#475569;font-size:0.75em;margin-left:6px;\">AAPL</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.88em;font-weight:600;\">296.42</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.07);border-radius:20px;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">+0.27%</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.8em;\">LG이노텍, 삼성전기</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #1e293b;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.9em;\">마이크로소프트</span><span style=\"color:#475569;font-size:0.75em;margin-left:6px;\">MSFT</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.88em;font-weight:600;\">399.76</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.07);border-radius:20px;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">+2.41%</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.8em;\">카카오, NAVER</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #1e293b;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.9em;\">테슬라</span><span style=\"color:#475569;font-size:0.75em;margin-left:6px;\">TSLA</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.88em;font-weight:600;\">411.15</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.07);border-radius:20px;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">+3.01%</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.8em;\">LG에너지솔루션, 삼성SDI, 포스코퓨처엠</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #1e293b;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.9em;\">아마존</span><span style=\"color:#475569;font-size:0.75em;margin-left:6px;\">AMZN</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.88em;font-weight:600;\">246.02</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.07);border-radius:20px;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">+1.87%</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.8em;\">쿠팡</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #1e293b;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.9em;\">알파벳</span><span style=\"color:#475569;font-size:0.75em;margin-left:6px;\">GOOGL</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.88em;font-weight:600;\">369.35</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.07);border-radius:20px;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">+3.24%</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.8em;\">카카오, NAVER</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #1e293b;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;white-space:nowrap;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.9em;\">메타</span><span style=\"color:#475569;font-size:0.75em;margin-left:6px;\">META</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:0.88em;font-weight:600;\">593.48</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:rgba(34,197,94,0.07);border-radius:20px;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:700;color:#22c55e;\">+4.41%</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;color:#64748b;font-size:0.8em;\">카카오</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n\n<div style=\"padding:0 4px;\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 1.8em;color:#334155;font-size:1.05em;padding:16px 20px;background:#f1f5f9;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #0052cc;\">오늘 나스닥이 3%대 상승 마감했고, AI·반도체 주가 급등이 핵심 동력이다.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.95;margin:0.9em 0;color:#333;font-size:1em;\">달러는 변동성 없이 0.03% 상승에 머물렀으며, 원/달러는 전일 대비 큰 변동 없이 안정세다.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:1.15em;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin:2.4em 0 0.9em;padding-left:14px;border-left:4px solid #0052cc;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#0052cc;color:#fff;font-size:0.68em;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px;vertical-align:middle;letter-spacing:1px;font-family:monospace;\">OPEN</span>간밤 미국 증시 요약</h2>\n<ul style=\"padding-left:1.5em;line-height:2.0;margin:0.5em 0;\">\n  <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">나스닥 26,683.94로 전일 대비 +3.39% 마감, AI·반도체 주도 상승 <sup style=\"font-size:0.75em;color:#888;\">[출처: 데이터]</sup></li>\n  <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">S&P500 7,554.29, +2.16% 상승, 대형 기술주와 에너지 주가 회복이 기여 <sup style=\"font-size:0.75em;color:#888;\">[출처: 데이터]</sup></li>\n  <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">다우존스 51,671.03, +1.62% 상승, 경기 민감주와 방어주가 고르게 상승 <sup style=\"font-size:0.75em;color:#888;\">[출처: 데이터]</sup></li>\n  <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">VIX 16.16, -0.25% 하락, 변동성 위축이 투자 심리 개선에 작용 <sup style=\"font-size:0.75em;color:#888;\">[출처: 데이터]</sup></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:1.15em;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin:2.4em 0 0.9em;padding-left:14px;border-left:4px solid #057a55;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#057a55;color:#fff;font-size:0.68em;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px;vertical-align:middle;letter-spacing:1px;font-family:monospace;\">DRIVER</span>핵심 드라이버</h2>\n<ul style=\"padding-left:1.5em;line-height:2.0;margin:0.5em 0;\">\n  <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>AI 칩 급등</strong>: NVDA +3.7%, AMD +12.04%, 인텔 +9.32% 상승. AI 서버 수요 기대감이 반도체 대열을 끌어올렸다.</li>\n  <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>에너지 가격 회복</strong>: WTI 78.39달러, -2.92% 하락에도 원유 관련 주가가 반등, APA·Conoco 등 에너지 기업에 긍정적 신호가 전달됐다.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:1.15em;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin:2.4em 0 0.9em;padding-left:14px;border-left:4px solid #b45309;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#b45309;color:#fff;font-size:0.68em;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px;vertical-align:middle;letter-spacing:1px;font-family:monospace;\">SECTOR</span>섹터별 흐름</h2>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:12px;margin:1em 0;\"><div><div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #0052cc;\"><strong style=\"color:#0052cc;font-size:0.9em;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">반도체</strong><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.88em;color:#475569;line-height:1.65;\">NVDA, AMD, 인텔 동시 상승, TSMC +4.83%까지 상승세 확대.</p></div></div><div><div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #057a55;\"><strong style=\"color:#057a55;font-size:0.9em;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">클라우드·소프트웨어</strong><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.88em;color:#475569;line-height:1.65;\">MSFT +2.41% 상승, 구글·메타 각각 +3.24%, +4.41% 상승.</p></div></div><div><div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #b45309;\"><strong style=\"color:#b45309;font-size:0.9em;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">전기차·배터리</strong><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.88em;color:#475569;line-height:1.65;\">TSLA +3.01% 상승, 배터리 소재 기업에 긍정적 파급.</p></div></div><div><div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #6d28d9;\"><strong style=\"color:#6d28d9;font-size:0.9em;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">소비재</strong><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.88em;color:#475569;line-height:1.65;\">아마존 +1.87% 상승, 월마트·쿠팡 연계 기대감.</p></div></div><div><div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #b91c1c;\"><strong style=\"color:#b91c1c;font-size:0.9em;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">에너지</strong><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.88em;color:#475569;line-height:1.65;\">WTI 하락에도 APA 인수 소식으로 에너지 섹터 리스크 재평가.</p></div></div></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:1.15em;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin:2.4em 0 0.9em;padding-left:14px;border-left:4px solid #6d28d9;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#6d28d9;color:#fff;font-size:0.68em;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px;vertical-align:middle;letter-spacing:1px;font-family:monospace;\">KR</span>오늘 코스피·코스닥 영향 예측</h2>\n<ul style=\"padding-left:1.5em;line-height:2.0;margin:0.5em 0;\">\n  <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>코스피</strong>: AI·반도체 연계주 상승 기대감에 0.5~1% 상승 가능성. 삼성전자·SK하이닉스 등 대형주가 매수세를 견인.</li>\n  <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>코스닥</strong>: AI·바이오 연계 중소형주가 1~2% 급등할 여지. 특히 메모리·시스템 반도체 기업이 강세를 받을 것으로 보임.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:1.15em;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin:2.4em 0 0.9em;padding-left:14px;border-left:4px solid #b91c1c;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#b91c1c;color:#fff;font-size:0.68em;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px;vertical-align:middle;letter-spacing:1px;font-family:monospace;\">WATCH</span>한국 연관 종목 체크</h2>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:12px;margin:1em 0;\"><div><div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #0052cc;\"><strong style=\"color:#0052cc;font-size:0.9em;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">삼성전자</strong><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.88em;color:#475569;line-height:1.65;\">NVDA·AMD 상승 → 메모리·GPU 수요 확대 기대.</p></div></div><div><div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #057a55;\"><strong style=\"color:#057a55;font-size:0.9em;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">SK하이닉스</strong><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.88em;color:#475569;line-height:1.65;\">AMD·인텔 호재에 메모리 가격 상승 기대.</p></div></div><div><div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #b45309;\"><strong style=\"color:#b45309;font-size:0.9em;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">한미반도체</strong><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.88em;color:#475569;line-height:1.65;\">NVDA 상승에 파운드리 수주 확대 가능성.</p></div></div><div><div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #6d28d9;\"><strong style=\"color:#6d28d9;font-size:0.9em;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">LG이노텍</strong><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.88em;color:#475569;line-height:1.65;\">애플 주가 소폭 상승 (+0.27%)에 따라 스마트폰 부품 수요 회복 기대.</p></div></div><div><div style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:3px solid #b91c1c;\"><strong style=\"color:#b91c1c;font-size:0.9em;letter-spacing:0.3px;\">LG에너지솔루션</strong><p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.88em;color:#475569;line-height:1.65;\">TSLA 상승에 배터리 수요 긍정적 전망.</p></div></div></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:1.15em;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin:2.4em 0 0.9em;padding-left:14px;border-left:4px solid #0e7490;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#0e7490;color:#fff;font-size:0.68em;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px;vertical-align:middle;letter-spacing:1px;font-family:monospace;\">RISK</span>오늘의 리스크 & 체크리스트</h2>\n<ul style=\"padding-left:1.5em;line-height:2.0;margin:0.5em 0;\">\n  <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>리스크</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.95;margin:0.9em 0;color:#333;font-size:1em;\">1. 연방준비제도(Fed) 금리 정책 발표 전환 가능성.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.95;margin:0.9em 0;color:#333;font-size:1em;\">2. 유럽 규제당국의 테슬라 FSD 데이터 조사 확대.</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-left:1.5em;line-height:2.0;margin:0.5em 0;\">\n  <li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>체크리스트</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.95;margin:0.9em 0;color:#333;font-size:1em;\">1. 미국 주요 지수 선물 흐름 확인.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.95;margin:0.9em 0;color:#333;font-size:1em;\">2. 원/달러 환율 변동성 점검.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.95;margin:0.9em 0;color:#333;font-size:1em;\">3. 주요 AI 기업 실적 가이던스 발표 여부 확인.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:1.15em;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin:2.4em 0 0.9em;padding-left:14px;border-left:4px solid #1e293b;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#1e293b;color:#fff;font-size:0.68em;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px;vertical-align:middle;letter-spacing:1px;font-family:monospace;\">SUMMARY</span>3줄 요약</h2>\n<div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e293b 0%,#0f172a 100%);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 24px;margin:1.8em 0;\"><p style=\"font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;margin:0 0 12px;font-size:0.75em;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-family:monospace;\">SUMMARY</p><ul style=\"padding-left:1.3em;margin:0;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.75;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.95em;\">AI·반도체 주가 급등, 나스닥 3%대 상승.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.75;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.95em;\">원/달러 안정, 에너지 가격 회복 기대감이 시장을 지지.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.75;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:0.95em;\">코스피·코스닥은 반도체·AI 연계주 중심으로 상승세 지속 가능.</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:2em;padding:14px 18px;background:#f1f5f9;border-radius:8px;\nfont-size:0.8em;color:#94a3b8;line-height:1.8;border-left:3px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n본 콘텐츠는 공개 데이터 기반 자동 생성 정보로, 투자 권유가 아닙니다. 실제 투자 결정은 본인 판단 하에 전문가와 상담 후 진행하시기 바랍니다.\n</div>\n\n</div>",
